   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Soft filmic: highlights capped (~212), gentle blacks (~18), medium-low saturation (0.26), subtle magenta-pink shadow tint, warm skin (~163/127/102). Best for: Couple portraits, soft window light, pre-wedding shoots, sangeet and mehendi in shade. Flattering on skin; ideal for intimate frames rather than big venue wides.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
